# New Character Cutscenes next to the missions whose zone-in containers run before its own (the trace order
# lines), Northern San d'Oria: a level 75 char of nation 0 with ROV off and the quest's notSeen 1 (a GM; charCreate
# writes it). Road Forks 14 at login; Rumors yields to the quest at notSeen 1 and shows 878 at 0; Coming of Age 16;
# Heir to the Light 1 at status 0, 0 at status 4.
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=128.3,-6.5,97.2 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
charvar HQuest[newCharacterCS]notSeen 1 # a GM
mission Cop AncientFlamesBeckon completed # a GM: the log's current mission cleared
mission Cop TheRoadForks current        # a GM
login                                   # CoP's Road Forks first
finish
mission Cop TheRoadForks completed      # a GM
mission Soa RumorsFromTheWest current   # a GM
charvar HQuest[newCharacterCS]notSeen 1 # a GM
warp 128.3,-6.5,97.2 NorthernSanDoria   # Rumors' check fails while the quest's notSeen is 1
finish
warp 128.3,-6.5,97.2 NorthernSanDoria   # notSeen 0: Rumors
finish
mission Soa RumorsFromTheWest completed # a GM
mission Sandoria ComingOfAge current    # a GM
mission Sandoria ComingOfAge completed  # a GM: its Progress is the time its last cutscene waits for
charvar Mission[0][20]Progress 1        # a GM: long past
charvar HQuest[newCharacterCS]notSeen 1 # a GM
warp 128.3,-6.5,97.2 NorthernSanDoria   # Coming of Age's 16
finish
mission Sandoria TheHeirToTheLight current # a GM
missionstatus Sandoria 0                # a GM
charvar HQuest[newCharacterCS]notSeen 1 # a GM
warp 128.3,-6.5,97.2 NorthernSanDoria   # the Heir to the Light at status 0
finish
missionstatus Sandoria 4                # a GM
charvar HQuest[newCharacterCS]notSeen 1 # a GM
warp 128.3,-6.5,97.2 NorthernSanDoria   # the Heir to the Light at status 4
finish
